      "content": "To frame your results for a high-impact appearance, focus on **quantifiable outcomes** rather than just activities. Instead of saying \"we planted trees,\" state \"we reforested 5,000 hectares, resulting in a 15% increase in local biodiversity index within 18 months.\" Furthermore, always tie your project successes directly to the *goals* of the Global Environment Fund to demonstrate strategic alignment and clear, responsible use of resources.",
